    "viewport": "390x844 (Playwright default chromium, no device emulation)",
    "dist": "composeWebCompatibility (wasm branch)",
    "transitionsMeasured": "each of the 5 nav tabs clicked once from the previous route, 500ms sampling window per click, plus a rapid 3-click sequence (Слова->Прогресс->Карточки, no waiting) sampled over 600ms",
